matic models and getting the OOB update released, allowing the affected devices to receive the bumper batch of security fixes released this month. However, the fact that an OOB was required at all does not speak well of the Microsoft's approach to quality, particularly since the underlying issue was introduced in the previous month. Â®ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;JXSh4uX32CO8JC0ECq93awZPY6ooXz_XstUx6Pkr0Xcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx@Microsoft rushes out Windows fix for Dell's hot and bothered PCsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;m8Ux-jNLck7XNv-MfR0ORyRcdKMuZikpyod33kvrNSUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;rj2E6qlfjRoFzrexGflr5miBj9f0qMuGxlA-yQVNMrYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx{https://www.theregister.com/os-platforms/2026/07/20/microsoft-rushes-out-windows-fix-for-dells-hot-and-bothered-pcs/5274810ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;OHVxFjnxIyifK5EFD38w2iu4ido9QiLf0ct0zrqgKZwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx@microsoft-rushes-out-windows-fix-for-dell-s-hot-and-bothered-pcsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;AUAeeuMCCVJEk1st9IS9E3C1LxPZxI7E8DT8mCWIaLwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;7zZPzcRO8Vbmk3iBmSlXNwZnILGg8xm0fdSmusJ6vCQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkjtechnologyƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Yjcl4w_-8spKaNTm9OWs_haKDTWys4zB_T6ouOyjYpEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleft